===Etymology===
{{MHG.|de}} ''schīze'', originally *''schīte'', from a {{Ger.|de}} root ''*skeit-a-'', this from an {{IE.|de}} root ''*skei-d-'' with the meaning "to [[part]]" (as in Greek ''Σχιστός'').

